    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d542">

                <pb facs="0589" n="583" sameAs="frus:frus1894app1/pg583"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Foster to Sir
                            Julian Pauncefote.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1892-11-21"><hi rendition="#italic">November 21,
                        1892</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Adverting to our conversation of the 17th
                    instant, I have the honor to send yon herewith, for your information, copies of
                    a note from the imperial German chargé, November 15, and of my reply thereto,
                    November 18, with respect to the offices of president of the municipal council
                    of Apia and chief justice of Samoa.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">John W. Foster.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
